# Cross-origin isolation for every response — without COOP/COEP the browser
# refuses SharedArrayBuffer/Memory64 and the in-tab checker cannot start.
# Applied by Workers static assets (and Cloudflare Pages) even when a
# request is served before the worker script runs; infra/worker.js sets the
# same headers for the R2-backed artifact paths.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
